      "message": "test: characterize current txdata reuse state\n\nPrecomputedTransactionData::Init() currently allows a second initialization after a forced precompute with no spent outputs, because that path leaves m_spent_outputs_ready false.\nDocument the resulting stale BIP143 state before changing it: cached witness-v0 hashing can still read hashes computed before the transaction changed.\n\nThe same test exercises the old assertion blind spot by clearing only m_spent_outputs_ready after a full forced precompute and showing the other optional readiness flags survive another Init().",
