        }
      ],
      "message": "script: reset precomputed txdata before init\n\nPrecomputedTransactionData::Init() already accepted one reuse shape: a forced precompute with no spent outputs left m_spent_outputs_ready false, so a later call passed the old assertion.\nThe characterization test showed that this left stale BIP143 readiness and made cached witness-v0 hashing read hashes from before the transaction changed. It also showed that the old assertion only guarded m_spent_outputs_ready, so other optional readiness flags could remain stale if that flag was false.\n\nReset the optional readiness flags before computing the new transaction state.\nThe test now checks that reinitialization clears stale readiness state and keeps cached witness-v0 hashing on the uncached path.",
